  "details": "   * SECURITY UPDATE: Malicious SVG file resulted in a DoS attack\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2025-68618.patch: fix DOS when processing a specially\n       crafted malicious SVG file\n     - CVE-2025-68618\n   * SECURITY UPDATE: WriteSVGImage function, using an int variable to store\n      number_attributes caused an integer overflow and trigger a DoS attack\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2025-69204.patch: fix DOS due to integer overflow\n       during image processing of a specially crafted SVG image\n     - CVE-2025-69204",
